1795485132466830	scourge-lead	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1zo	{"description":"# Context\\nThe mandatory just check gate calls scripts/check-m1-recut.py. Its frozen M0 disposition currently asserts every kept M1 bone remains open, so the standard Edict start transition (open to doing) makes every legitimate M1 workspace fail. KEEP describes scope disposition, not lifecycle.\\n\\n# Do\\n- Accept the normal Bones lifecycle states for all 55 kept bones without weakening the frozen M1 membership, parent, dependency, acceptance-hash, or contract-route checks.\\n- Keep rejecting unknown/invalid lifecycle values.\\n- Replace the regression that requires closed bones to fail with coverage for open, doing, and done plus an invalid-state failure.\\n\\n# Acceptance\\n- [ ] scripts/test-m1-recut.py covers open, doing, done and an invalid state.\\n- [ ] just m1-recut-check passes while bn-xwe and bn-26c are doing.\\n- [ ] No frozen contract or tracker dependency projection changes.","kind":"bug","labels":["integration","test"],"size":"s","title":"Make the frozen M1 re-cut check lifecycle-aware"}	blake3:U1_9AsCF6rapHm-qYh5DDKNNpfKt521oCYhbvjWnbUg
