1795490516617379	scourge-orca-2ij	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2ij	{"body":"scourge-orca-2ij: review fixes committed at c2b32c257905704e6e940eb751a41dfa9ab61c3c (parent 3fea0fd conflict resolution, which parents bb230fd Seal checkpoint and c5b1780 request-key work; base main f0341f6). Resolved the one Maw conflict in crates/scourge-core/src/lib.rs by keeping both current-main policy/store modules and the bn-2ij request module; committed only that file as 3fea0fd.\n\nFixed all open threads in cr-1ip1z5: th-3pzown (declare_request uses strict create_run, never adopts or rewrites a runs row; v2 legacy finalized/unknown-effect regression), th-3qhl0u (read-time integrity: canonical bytes, digest, command, selector pairing, key->run->engagement binding, receipt audit; INTEGRITY_FAILURE/6; migration 004 adds UNIQUE(run_id) and drops the unused scope index), th-1chb3n (explicit engagement/lead revisions must exist in the selected engagement; lead/finding selectors engagement-scoped; foreign and absent share OBJECT_NOT_FOUND/3), th-zvjwo8 (atomic accept-or-reopen on same key+input, deferred read-snapshot replays and lookups, 500 ms busy timeout mapping to typed CONFLICTING_RUN/4), th-1b6xlj nits (duplicate step numbers refused, request_key_scopes removed, NormalizedInput::read_canonical authoritative).\n\nValidation at HEAD: TMPDIR=/home/bob/src/scourge/.maw/cache/t just check exit 0 (15 test-result-ok blocks); cargo test -p scourge-core = 35 lib (3 consecutive runs) + 15 contracts + 10 engagement_policy + 10 request_input + 2 doc; cargo clippy -D warnings and cargo fmt --check clean; independent scratch harness .maw/cache/bn-2ij-verify green 2x (200 x 3-caller identical races, 200 replay-vs-mint races, v2 migration, tamper, contention).\n\nReview: cr-1ip1z5 retargeted to base f0341f6e408e2ddeab6fb847e7028be8e0fec7ec and target/scm anchor detached:c2b32c257905704e6e940eb751a41dfa9ab61c3c; prior vote cleared; reviewers [scourge-security]; status open; 5 threads replied to, left for the reviewer to resolve. Rite re-review anchor 01M85S5MX5NWR1023QT8F8J065 in #scourge (label review-response, hook hk-vkg).\n\nNot merged, not approved, not closed, not pushed; workspace and claims retained. Remaining: fresh scourge-security vote on the retargeted range."}	blake3:Ej85oIOw0WHpgS0wj7dJOCtWnczzh0pXfbpx-cGVZig
