1795539983774584	scourge-lead	itc:AQ		item.update	bn-1rg	{"field":"description","value":"Context: During bn-14o validation at synced HEAD 38b3a4b88ae768606c45ba72e885617e7fec3d74, one full just check run made wrapper_only_failure_retains_wrapper_exit observe NativeFailure where the test expected ToolUnavailable. The exact unchanged full-suite retry passed. The wrapper/process source was unchanged by the accounting work, and no diagnostic captured the spawn failure cause. Do not guess that this was timing. Acceptance: (1) stress the exact focused case and full-suite context with bounded repetitions and capture exit/status/stdout/stderr plus host resource errors on any failure; (2) if reproducible, fix the classification boundary without weakening bounded transport or typed wrapper diagnostics; (3) if not reproducible, add deterministic fault injection covering the suspected unclassified spawn branch and document the qualification limit; (4) just check remains stable. This must be resolved or explicitly adjudicated before the M1 cold trial closes."}	blake3:7dTRowaZgAacArkVWHiYRU-LY7fwpP7JaTQSy238t1c
