1795542671378782	scourge-orca-teapot	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3s5	{"body":"Implementation handoff, bone remains doing. Exact HEAD 67b6d977a58132243ba0208621400d01d69a5166 on base ba3b75fe41943d2ebfae501c6b5441ac4dbb43ca. Maw sync safely replayed the preserved partial commit 35d5537672418f33cc26f6871267a1ec798af60a as 859ebd1; conflict resolution 7bb4dcc kept the current epoch and re-applied the partial work. Dirty state is only untracked .seal/reviews/cr-vprkb6/events.jsonl. Implemented: exact frozen requests send with the nullable flow ID; --yes macros run with optional --until; schema-only --yes flows replay --macro/--step/--set; exact stored-flow reads with method/status/origin/parent/retry/timing and derived destination; DispatchEvidence NoFlow (sent, capture off/lost) distinct from NotSent; login and retry flows bound to their step; owned-job cancel retained. Validation: 22 focused teapot tests, 4/4 digest-pinned Teapot contract tests (SCOURGE_PINNED_TEAPOT=/tmp/scourge-bn-1b4-target/debug/teapot) covering live send, two-step macro, replay, capture-off no-flow, stored read and terminal cancel; just m1-recut-check; cargo fmt; clippy -D warnings; full just check. Review cr-vprkb6 was retargeted to 67b6d97 on base ba3b75f and carries a comment with exact scope and limits. Remaining review work: independent review at that target. Known limits: M0.7 registry capture for macro_replay is still null (only the tested two-step shape is live-qualified); capture loss mid-flow is not separately injected; flow heads are rendered text while bodies are exact stored windows; destination is derived from the recorded URL; Teapot still exposes no durable caller per-send reference. Workspace not merged, pushed, voted, closed or destroyed."}	blake3:p6gBMHmFHsvb0cfoNBAPPBu4tqa-WzWysPeSDHW2DJ4
