1795542867830360	scourge-orca-teapot	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-3s5	{"body":"Resynced onto current main, bone remains doing. Exact HEAD 24d538a7a48300a6e923429d14602e94bca71ad4 on base 152435b2ed939ce0d19adb1b232e216e063e03bb. Maw ws sync replayed all three workspace commits cleanly onto reviewed main 152435b (6da6ccd, 107bf1b, 24d538a); no conflict, no merge, no push, and no new commit was required. Main's reviewed immutable test-script launcher and spawn classification are present. Dirty state is only untracked .seal/reviews/cr-vprkb6/events.jsonl. Validation after sync: cargo fmt --check clean; clippy --workspace --all-targets --locked -D warnings clean; 22 focused teapot_invocation tests passed; 4/4 digest-pinned Teapot contract tests passed with SCOURGE_PINNED_TEAPOT=/tmp/scourge-bn-1b4-target/debug/teapot (live send, two-step macro, macro replay, capture-off no-flow, stored read, terminal cancel); just m1-recut-check passed; full normal parallel just check passed with no serialization. Review cr-vprkb6 retargeted to 24d538a on base 152435b and carries exact evidence and limits. Remaining review work: independent review at that target. Limits unchanged: M0.7 registry capture for macro_replay remains null and only the tested two-step shape is live-qualified; capture-lost mid-flow is not separately injected; flow heads are rendered text while body windows are exact; destination is derived from the recorded URL; Teapot still exposes no durable caller per-send reference. Workspace not merged, pushed, voted, closed or destroyed."}	blake3:CONpd4-WKxJyi_cSM7ucJdqtp9oRYApvUDAmX3M08kA
