1795586557677438	scourge-lead	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1hv	{"description":"The production verifier currently returns an active acquired run from execute_live, while publication staging requires a finalized run. Implement one Store transaction that validates the exact acquired run, acceptance receipt, summary and candidate; settles the keyed run; and stages the publication candidate together. A separate finalize-before-stage write is forbidden because it leaves an unrecoverable crash window. Preserve already-finalized callers, head CAS and reconcile behavior. Add interruption, stale receipt, mismatched candidate and idempotent replay tests. This child blocks bn-23g and is complete only with focused tests, strict Clippy, full serialized check and exact native review.","kind":"bug","labels":["m1","verifier","durability"],"parent":"bn-24s","size":"m","title":"Settle acquired runs and stage publication atomically"}	blake3:mykROfHfOw6hgtjS_Rmzzlx4en33YdFJzv9Y5rIaotY
