1795586587968626	scourge-lead	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-3ak	{"description":"Add the minimal typed operator-owned runtime binding needed by CLI verify: accepted canonical manifest and evidence pin/artifact, pass path and digest, exact Teapot BoundEngine identity, Investigation executable plus case/import/scratch roots, target identity/origin, and trusted operator principal slot overrides. Extend Authority/binding validation and CLI dispatch so absent or conflicting runtime authority returns a typed pre-traffic refusal. This task must not open Evidence, start Teapot, send traffic, evaluate an oracle or publish a record. Preserve passive project bindings and backward-compatible unbound/read behavior. Add serialization, absolute-path, conflict, missing-field and no-adapter-open tests. This child blocks bn-23g and requires strict validation plus exact native review.","kind":"task","labels":["m1","verifier","surface"],"parent":"bn-24s","size":"m","title":"Bind verifier runtime authority without opening adapters"}	blake3:1kdTczTkSYisx7dsYoz-tP8c1_aQI3_C7nYBGeHa-qI
