1795587069407219	scourge-verify-badge	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-23g	{"body":"Committed the passive coherent-read/full-badge tranche in the existing bn-23g workspace. Main base d9624b9980a89256c460ece23a45b35c3645aabc; tranche base d15aa6b15e84de7433e996578cd17e61e667725e; exact target 8a253abe347f93cb9c56f60703f5ddec979668f7. Changed Cargo.lock, crates/scourge-verify/src/{coherent_read.rs,status.rs,record/tests.rs}, crates/scourge/{Cargo.toml,src/lib.rs,src/read.rs,tests/read_process.rs}. Offline verifier library (33 tests), CLI library/read process, strict workspace all-target/all-feature Clippy, and full serialized RUST_TEST_THREADS=1 CARGO_NET_OFFLINE=true just check passed. The full check required a host retry after default sandbox refused two pre-existing mocked worker-topology tests; the retry passed without skips added. SQLite witnesses cover distinct status/deciding records, applicable policy admission at the named snapshot, third-party custody, and concurrent objection/binding revision with historical fallback. Frozen Finding JSON, text and pretty rendering qualify through the passive caller-supplied Evidence seam. Stock dispatch still reports capability unavailable until the trusted Evidence binding is wired. No tracked edits remain. The only untracked files are Seal journals cr-2z5aud and cr-efjul8, byte-identical to /tmp/bn-23g-recovery. Remaining bn-23g acceptance includes typed operator runtime and Evidence authority, production acquisition and default two rounds, atomic settle/stage and publication, exact native ceiling/custody/isolation enforcement, owned fixture CLI verify/show proof, live F-48 inertness and fresh exact review. Bone remains doing and unmerged."}	blake3:-yrgQ6en-0cx0Y6_9H_yOflXgSAlvsE0YCz6ZV8IQnI
