1795590012041256	scourge-verify-badge	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-23g	{"body":"Synced existing Maw workspace onto exact main 652fa15629c469d2ab1138b1ee4bc9345b69d8e3. Clean two-commit replay: plan b445567755d2869007085f47e6df6297994b74b2 and badge HEAD 3f4323989338c473268e23d7f81899a69a1bf93b. Maw recorded only lib.rs; resolved by preserving early plan/oracle/slot refusals and retaining the reviewed runtime-authority error mapping only after a successful passive projection for a non-plan call. verify remains effect-disabled. Range-diff marks the badge equivalent; full-index plan patch matches outside lib.rs/verify.rs, badge patch outside record/tests.rs, and the edited lines in that test file are identical across the upstream blob shift. Reviewed upstream authority, atomic settlement, plan budget, rounds, preflight, Teapot and record implementation files match main. New full-index binary Git patch SHA-256 values: plan a5218b278c0790e4241660ee3e215da37c80b00ea007c04b97a4302fd5ff09cd, badge 4f10fcf66d4fd6f5a2528a8a8e7a5b7f0f68205aea7b37934405192bebf86039, combined 43df46f2cfc0109a9334144997084591919339e98fd1ed5e4d90e4ba3ccce0d8. Each journal was restored and cmp-verified against backup and named stash: cr-1l2v8s cd945d040d557c726e220cc84b5e6ba3729dc32729efbbca324f4b1465c10a35, cr-2z5aud e704ab8419341d599fef3ffbf3f7c871ca9473f9e95761d9001a51171f8f0e99, cr-efjul8 ca7d77f44359d628830c930899ea3344669ad882f26ee58b294315f8fd45d9c5. Recovery evidence, provisional replay Git bundle, indexes, stashes.txt, patches and logs retained in /tmp/bn-23g-recovery/sync-652fa1-8a253ab. Exact HEAD focused verifier (34 tests) and CLI suites, all-target/all-feature locked Clippy, and serialized offline just check passed on host without added skips. Initial sandbox CLI fixture run denied owned loopback sockets. No tracked edits or conflicts remain. Remaining work: bind qualified Evidence to stock reads, route native passive budget into CLI plans, wire effectful default two-round acquisition through settlement/staging and publication, qualify isolation/custody/accounting and exact owned fixture verify/show plus live F-48, then fresh final review. Bone remains doing and unmerged."}	blake3:9h-t8WZ2UJF8jim0d1TtePF0lDE4IXHsELwEZsQ_UKI
