1795660788454797	scourge-lead	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-3sul	{"description":"Close the retained M1.7 qualification gap without changing the approved conservative recovery semantics. Through the exact owned-loopback fixture and real qualified instrument path, issue one act-then-drop plant request whose target mutation commits while the client loses the response; retain the run-bound dispatch evidence; reconcile the original run to effects unknown; prove no automatic or reconciliation resend and preserve request key, run identity, cleanup obligation, and conflict fence. Also exercise real-adapter histories for a send with no retained flow, equal request digests from distinct sends, and a recorded refusal before dispatch. Record exact target request counts and retained evidence. This is qualification evidence, not a claim of exactly-once effects. Depends on completed M1.7 plus the runnable M1.8 demo/runtime. Add the resulting named check to the ordinary M1 invariant gate before the cold-agent trial.","kind":"task","labels":["m1","test","qualification"],"parent":"bn-2e6","size":"s","title":"Qualify lost-response recovery on the owned act-then-drop fixture"}	blake3:3A22MPPS5C13zqwd_AAHmyqueYJNduFaQKMYOOQHVtY
