1795666457263042	scourge-lead	itc:AQ		item.create	bn-1im6	{"description":"Add a narrowly reviewed run-bound receipt for a real adapter refusal that proves a request was not dispatched. The current Teapot adapter returns native exit 4/out-of-scope as InvocationError and execute_step conservatively records effects unknown; error prose or exit code alone must not establish Effect::None. Bind typed pre-dispatch evidence to the accepted run, request key, step identity, exact argv/digest, instrument identity, and scoped target; reject replay, nearby flows, untrusted prose, and seeded synthetic receipts. Exercise the owned loopback with a same-origin out-of-scope first/only step, prove zero target requests, retain not-sent provenance, reconcile the original run to Effect::None without resend, and preserve conflict/replay fences. This supports bn-3sul F-12 qualification and does not relax the general unknown-on-ambiguous-send rule.","kind":"task","labels":["interface","recovery","test"],"parent":"bn-3sul","size":"s","title":"Retain typed pre-dispatch refusal evidence for recovery"}	blake3:23aEq1urxYGBmwCEN6oOy-MgmQgMJLy4ext9OZ5bAkE
